  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are better, faster, or stronger than the average spirit.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Must be a shikigami</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose an ability score other than Constitution. You gain a +2 insight bonus to the chosen ability score.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Exceptional Spirit multiple times. Each time, choose a different ability score.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shikigami-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
